WEBVTT

00:21:58.621 --> 00:22:02.413
it's more likely that you will start
to recognize the losses.

00:22:02.704 --> 00:22:06.246
So if I'm a CEO, are you saying I
should fire all my executives

00:22:06.246 --> 00:22:09.329
so that people are finally willing
to cut their losses?

00:22:09.371 --> 00:22:13.329
Well, I wouldn't maybe go that far.

00:22:13.746 --> 00:22:16.288
If you don't have turnover
inside your organization,

00:22:16.496 --> 00:22:18.621
you at least need an outside perspective,

00:22:18.663 --> 00:22:25.079
somebody who can look at things with
a kind of a cold eye and say,

00:22:25.496 --> 00:22:28.538
this is what I would do if I
were facing this situation.

00:22:28.871 --> 00:22:32.371
This is the first of three important steps
organizations can take to prevent